S = {'cc': 'IT', 'fam': 'Social', 'doc': '# IT 2025: employer social contributions (2200) and payroll taxes (3000)\n\nSource: INPS (official): "Aliquote contributive" (inps.it, page updated 27 September 2024, `it/law/inps_aliquote_contributive.html`), circolare n. 88 del 31.10.2023 (`it/law/inps_circ88_2023.pdf`), circolare n. 26 del 30.1.2025 (`it/law/inps_circ26_2025.pdf`); D.Lgs. 148/2015 art. 23 as read for the 1.x model (normattiva, vigente al 1.1.2025, `improve-central/refs/it/r8/dlgs148.html`).\n* INPS page: the IVS rate for workers insured with the Fondo pensioni lavoratori dipendenti (AGO) is 33 %; the rates of the other insurances (sickness, maternity, unemployment, CIG) depend on the sector, the size of the firm and the worker\'s grade\n* Circolare 88/2023: the 33 % is split as in the AGO for employees (D.Lgs. 166/1997 art. 1, commi 1 e 2): 23,81 % on the employer and 9,19 % on the worker\n* Circolare 26/2025: massimale annuo della base contributiva 2025 = 120 607 EUR (workers first insured after 1995, as in the 1.x model); prima fascia di retribuzione pensionabile 55 448 EUR (the +1 % above it is the employee\'s)\n* D.Lgs. 148/2015 art. 23 c. 1-bis: from 1.1.2022 employers with on average more than fifteen employees pay the CIGS ordinary contribution of 0,90 %, 0,30 % of it on the worker (so 0,60 % on the employer)\n* Convention (declared): an industrial employer with more than fifteen and at most fifty employees, as the 1.x model\'s employee (who pays the 0,30 % CIGS share); worker first insured after 1995 (massimale applies)\n* D.Lgs. 148/2015 art. 13 c. 1 (normattiva, vigente al 1.7.2025, `it/law/dlgs148_2015_art13_vig20250701.html`): the ordinary CIGO contribution is 1,70 % of the pay subject to contributions for industrial firms with up to 50 employees (2,00 % above 50); no ceiling: circolare 26/2025 par. 6 says the minor contributions are also due on pay above the massimale\n* Read, not modelled (pass 13): maternità, D.Lgs. 151/2001 art. 79 c. 1 a): 0,46 % for industry before the reductions of L. 266/2005 art. 1 c. 361 (not read); NASpI, L. 92/2012 art. 2 c. 25-26: financed by the contributions of L. 160/1975 art. 12 and 28 with the L. 388/2000 art. 120 and L. 266/2005 reductions (not read), 1,4 % extra on fixed-term contracts (c. 28); CUAF: rate act not read\n', 'lean': 'def c0 : Contribution := { name := "Contributo IVS al Fondo pensioni lavoratori dipendenti (quota datore di lavoro)", sched := Schedule.flat 2381, ceiling := 120607 }\ndef c1 : Contribution := { name := "Contributo ordinario CIGS (quota impresa)", sched := Schedule.flat 60, ceiling := -1 }\ndef c2 : Contribution := { name := "Contributo ordinario CIGO (imprese industriali fino a 50 dipendenti)", sched := Schedule.flat 170, ceiling := -1 }\n\ndef contribs : List (Contribution × Oecd × String) :=\n  [(c0, .sscEmployer, "INPS, Aliquote contributive (updated 27.9.2024): IVS for the FPLD (AGO) 33 %; INPS circolare 88/2023: the AGO split, 23,81 % employer and 9,19 % employee (D.Lgs. 166/1997 art. 1); massimale 120 607 EUR for 2025 (L. 335/1995 art. 2 c. 18; INPS circolare 26/2025)"),\n   (c1, .sscEmployer, "D.Lgs. 148/2015 art. 23 c. 1, 1-bis (text in force from 1.1.2022, read at 1.1.2025): 0,90 % of which 0,60 % on the employer, for employers with more than fifteen employees"),\n   (c2, .sscEmployer, "D.Lgs. 148/2015 art. 13 c. 1 a) (vigente al 1.7.2025): 1,70 per cento della retribuzione imponibile ai fini previdenziali, imprese industriali fino a 50 dipendenti")]\n\n/-- On the household\'s wages: each adult, each contribution (borne by the employer). -/\ndef householdCharges (g : CanonGlobal) : List Charge :=\n  if g.entity == .company then [] else\n  (g.household.adults.zipIdx.filter (fun (a, _) => 0 < a.wages)).flatMap fun (a, i) =>\n    contribs.map fun (c, o, st) =>\n      charge o c.name a.wages id (fun x => c.amount x) (event := s!"adult {i + 1}") (level := .social)\n        (bearer := .employer) (statute := st)\n\n/-- On a company\'s payroll, spread evenly over its employees (ceilings per employee). -/\ndef companyCharges (g : CanonGlobal) : List Charge :=\n  if g.entity != .company || g.company.payroll ≤ 0 then [] else\n  let n : Int := max 1 (g.company.employees : Int)\n  let avg := g.company.payroll / n\n  contribs.map fun (c, o, st) =>\n    charge o c.name g.company.payroll id (fun _ => n * c.amount avg) (event := "payroll") (level := .social)\n      (statute := st)\n', 'families': [('2200/3000 employer contributions', ['.sscEmployer'], 'householdCharges g ++ companyCharges g')], 'notes': ['IT 2200/3000: INPS page updated 2024-09-27; circolari 88/2023 and 26/2025; D.Lgs. 148/2015 art. 23 vigente 2025'], 'unsupported': [('g.household.adults.any (fun a => 0 < a.wages)', '2200 INPS minor employer contributions not modelled: NASpI (L. 92/2012 art. 2 c. 25: the L. 160/1975 rates less the L. 388/2000 and L. 266/2005 reductions, not read), maternità (D.Lgs. 151/2001 art. 79: 0,46 % industry before the L. 266/2005 reductions), CUAF, malattia (operai) and the INAIL premium (CIGO is modelled, pass 13)'), ('g.household.adults.any (fun a => 0 < a.wages)', "2200 INPS: the employer's exemptions (esonero contributivo, decontribuzione Sud) and the pre-1996 workers without massimale not modelled"), ('g.entity == .company && g.company.payroll > 0', 'company payroll spread evenly over its employees (per-employee ceilings applied to the average wage)')], 'guards': ['c0.amount 50000 == 11905', 'c0.amount 200000 == 28716', 'c1.amount 50000 == 300', 'c1.amount 200000 == 1200', 'c2.amount 50000 == 850', 'c2.amount 200000 == 3400'], 'taxes': [{'oecd': '2200', 'tax': 'Contributo IVS al Fondo pensioni lavoratori dipendenti (quota datore di lavoro)', 'statute': 'INPS, Aliquote contributive (updated 27.9.2024): IVS for the FPLD (AGO) 33 %; INPS circolare 88/2023: the AGO split, 23,81 % employer and 9,19 % employee (D.Lgs. 166/1997 art. 1); massimale 120 607 EUR for 2025 (L. 335/1995 art. 2 c. 18; INPS circolare 26/2025)', 'dated': 'INPS page updated 2024-09-27; circolari 88/2023 and 26/2025; D.Lgs. 148/2015 art. 23 vigente 2025', 'grade': 'B', 'kernel_parts': ['Contribution'], 'unsupported': []}, {'oecd': '2200', 'tax': 'Contributo ordinario CIGS (quota impresa)', 'statute': 'D.Lgs. 148/2015 art. 23 c. 1, 1-bis (text in force from 1.1.2022, read at 1.1.2025): 0,90 % of which 0,60 % on the employer, for employers with more than fifteen employees', 'dated': 'INPS page updated 2024-09-27; circolari 88/2023 and 26/2025; D.Lgs. 148/2015 art. 23 vigente 2025', 'grade': 'B', 'kernel_parts': ['Contribution'], 'unsupported': []}, {'oecd': '2200', 'tax': 'Contributo ordinario CIGO (imprese industriali fino a 50 dipendenti)', 'statute': 'D.Lgs. 148/2015 art. 13 c. 1 a) (vigente al 1.7.2025): 1,70 per cento della retribuzione imponibile ai fini previdenziali, imprese industriali fino a 50 dipendenti', 'dated': 'INPS page updated 2024-09-27; circolari 88/2023 and 26/2025; D.Lgs. 148/2015 art. 23 vigente 2025', 'grade': 'A', 'kernel_parts': ['Contribution'], 'unsupported': []}]}
